{"id":"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-godel-sentence.md","title":"Gödel Sentence","display":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-godel-sentence","aliases":["90-df-godel-sentence"],"display":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence","depends_on":["[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-godel-number]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-godel-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-godel-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d,a_T,\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(g,d,a_T,\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 呈示；无下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\sigma)\">\\(g(\\sigma)\\)</span>。谓词下标仍只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，其余项是已显式固定的环境常量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>公式应用均指无捕获语法代入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists q\\le p\\,\\theta\">\\(\\exists q\\le p\\,\\theta\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists q(q\\le p\\land\\theta)\">\\(\\exists q(q\\le p\\land\\theta)\\)</span>，其中对象算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>。定义本身不要求先选出固定点；存在性由相应构造文件证明。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (满足对角引理条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (internal provability formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nG\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(G\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner G\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nG\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\nT\\vdash\\bigl(G\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner G\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对角引理保证这类句子存在，但只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-可证等价的意义下确定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash G\">\\(T\\nvdash G\\)</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的一致性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\neg G\">\\(T\\nvdash\\neg G\\)</span> 还需适当的可靠性条件（经典 Gödel 版本可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性）。这些是后续定理，不属于定义本身。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-number","status":"resolved","id":"5e705f7962c302c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp